OL,3,GNEWSAMan drowned as family looked on,
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man drowned after being hit by a
OL,7,Flarge wave as his family looked on from
OL,8,Fthe shore, an inquest has heard.
OL,10,FSimon Lightbody, 48, from Reigate in
OL,11,FSurrey, was pulled from the water by
OL,12,Femergency services at Blackpool Sands
OL,13,Fnear Dartmouth in Devon on Monday
OL,14,Fafternoon after going for a swim.
OL,16,FAn inquest into his death was opened at
OL,17,FDevon Coroner's Court on Thursday and
OL,18,Fheard his cause of death had been given
OL,19,Fas drowning.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
