OL,3,GNEWSAMan drowned as family looked on,
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing was told Lightbody, who was
OL,7,Fborn in Northern Ireland, was "hit by a
OL,8,Flarge wave" and could not be seen in
OL,9,Fthe water by his watching family.
